# Keep the Docker build context small (the Dockerfile only needs backend-dotnet/Zayra.Api).
# A bloated context inflates build memory/time on Render's free-tier builder.
.git
**/node_modules
frontend
kynexbridge
.next
**/.next
.vercel
**/.vercel
**/bin
**/obj
database/*.sql
docs
*.md
.claude
e2e
**/*.test.*
